 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・種: 晩春に半分に切り戻して草丈を抑えられる（夏前に草丈を詰める）。花穂を取ると花期が延びる。秋に花穂を切り、春に枯れ葉を取る。'Sunset Dreams' と同じ扱い。機械の B から変更",
  "management_type_quote": "Plants (particularly those which typically grow tall) may be cut back in late spring by 1/2 to control size.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
  "heat_west_only": "強",
  "muggy_west_only": "強",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[乾燥耐性の読み直し] 乾燥耐性が 強 になり、日向・耐暑性 強 とそろったので、西日耐性 ○ → ◎\n[おぎはら/種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/種] A taprooted plant which tolerates heat, humidity and some drought.\n[NC State/種] It prefers full sun and will tolerate heat and humidity.\n[NC State/種] The taproot helps make it drought and heat tolerant.",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 1／MBG・種] May self-seed if spent flower stems are left（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・種] May self-seed if spent flower stems are left in place in the fall.\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち）",
